# Focus Frenzy Design System

Dark, raw, brutalist indie-game look. Must NOT look AI-generated.

## Banned (never use)
- Inter, Roboto, system-ui, or any default sans font
- Purple gradients as the primary background/brand fill
- Generic colored `box-shadow` (e.g. `shadow-lg`, `shadow-md`)
- White cards or light backgrounds
- `border-radius` > 14px on buttons

## Colors (Tailwind tokens — use these names only)
`bg #0a0a0f` · `surface #12121a` · `card #1a1a26` · `border rgba(255,255,255,0.06)`
`accent #ff2d55` · `teal #00f5d4` · `yellow #ffd60a` · `purple #bf5af2`
`muted #6e6e7a` · `success #30d158` · `danger #ff453a`

## Fonts (via `next/font/google` CSS vars)
- Display/logo/scores: **Bebas Neue** (`font-display`), letter-spacing `-1px` to `-2px`
- Labels/buttons: **Archivo Black** (`font-label`), letter-spacing `+2px` to `+4px`
- Body/mono: **Space Mono** (`font-mono`)

## Rules
- Borders: `1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06)` — thin, never harsh.
- Neon glow ONLY on score numbers: `filter: drop-shadow(0 0 12px <color>)`. Nowhere else.
- Buttons: solid background (not outlined), `rounded-[14px]` max, active state `scale-[0.96]`.
- Min font size 11px. Scores in Bebas Neue, min 28px.
- Mobile-first: `max-w-[480px]` centered. Touch targets min 44px.
- Keep the global grain (SVG `body::before`) + scanline (`body::after`) overlays intact.

```tsx
// BAD: AI-default card
<div className="rounded-2xl bg-white shadow-lg p-4 font-sans">

// GOOD
<div className="rounded-[12px] bg-card border border-border p-4 font-mono">
```
